      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for the clarification!\n\nThe CR vote hasn\u0027t changed. So this comment doesn\u0027t block the landing of this CL.\n\nThis is again for my clarification:\nI assume the check: `AidlVersion() \u003c 2` is for Keymint 2?\nIIRC, Keymint 2 was shipped with Android 12. Your previous comment mentioned: VSR 12 has to support RKP, but a device shipping with Android 12 doesn\u0027t.\nSo I am not sure how the check `AidlVersion() \u003c 2` is relevant here?",
